    through Model.controller and portraitMotions; the matching exp3 files remain
    as endpoint compatibility faces only. The model's ParamMouthOpenY drives speech,
    and every interrupted action returns to Idle. Source runtime: live2d-halfbody/\u89D2\u8272/\u963F\u661F_v13_\u7709\u95F4\u4FEE\u6B63/runtime."
